  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/64202479
  exerciseText: Blueprint progress bar not working
  hintText: Add a log on the progress normalized, what is it returning?
  solutionText: The code is doing an int division, which means the result is an int
    so it cannot store decimals. Cast one of the elements into a float.
